    "answer": {
      "short": "One face represents 10 people. Monday: 6 faces; Tuesday: 2; Wednesday: 5; Thursday: 5; Friday: 9.",
      "worked": "Use one face for 10 people.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Monday symbols}&=60\\div10=6\\\\\\text{Tuesday symbols}&=20\\div10=2\\\\\\text{Wednesday symbols}&=50\\div10=5\\\\\\text{Thursday symbols}&=50\\div10=5\\\\\\text{Friday symbols}&=90\\div10=9\\end{align*}$$\nDraw equal-sized, equally spaced faces in aligned rows and include the key.",
      "solutionDiagrams": [
        {
          "id": "p9-q3-supplied-pictogram",
          "role": "solution",
          "format": "tikz",
          "code": "% mathsmap-diagram-colours {\"version\":1,\"kind\":\"graph\",\"base\":[],\"semantic\":[],\"reference\":\"source page 9 p9-q3-supplied-pictogram\"}\n\\begin{tikzpicture}[x=1mm,y=1mm,line width=0.5pt,text=black,font=\\fontsize{10}{12}\\selectfont,every node/.style={inner sep=0pt}]\n\\special{dvisvgm:raw <metadata data-graph-strokes=\"1\"/>}\n\\def\\smiley{\\draw (0,0) circle (2.3);\\draw[line width=0.4pt] (-0.8,0.6) ellipse (0.55 and 0.75);\\draw[line width=0.4pt] (0.8,0.6) ellipse (0.55 and 0.75);\\fill (-0.8,0.6) circle (0.2);\\fill (0.8,0.6) circle (0.2);\\draw[line width=0.4pt] (-1.25,-0.55) .. controls (-0.7,-1.7) and (0.7,-1.7) .. (1.25,-0.55);}\n\\path[use as bounding box] (0,9) rectangle (78,-52);\n\\node[anchor=west] at (0,5) {Key:};\n\\begin{scope}[shift={(12,5)},scale=.7]\\smiley\\end{scope}\n\\node[anchor=west] at (15,5) {$=10$ people};\n\\draw (25,0)--(78,0)--(78,-52)--(0,-52)--(0,-12)--(25,-12)--cycle;\n\\draw (25,-12)--(25,-52) (39,0)--(39,-52);\n\\node[align=center] at (32,-6) {\\textbf{People}\\\\\\textbf{on bus}};\n\\foreach \\y in {-12,-20,-28,-36,-44}{\\draw (0,\\y)--(78,\\y);}\n\\foreach \\name/\\count/\\row in {Monday/6/1,Tuesday/2/2,Wednesday/5/3,Thursday/5/4,Friday/9/5}{\n\\node[anchor=center] at (12.5,{-8*\\row-8}) {\\textbf{\\name}};\n\\node at (32,{-8*\\row-8}) {\\pgfmathparse{int(10*\\count)}\\pgfmathresult};\n\\foreach \\j in {1,...,\\count}{\\begin{scope}[shift={({42+4.2*(\\j-1)},{-8*\\row-8})},scale=.7]\\smiley\\end{scope}}\n}\n\\end{tikzpicture}",
